Package: APomboCocaineSubmissionFigures
Title: Figure regeneration for the APombo cocaine VTA single-nucleus submission
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Standalone, self-contained reports that regenerate the manuscript
    figures (QC, differential expression, gene-set permutation, MERFISH) from the
    exported submission tables and objects. Not an installable package; the
    Imports list documents the pinned runtime environment.
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.5)
Imports:
    data.table,
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    stringr,
    ggplot2,
    ComplexHeatmap,
    Seurat (>= 5.0.0),
    SeuratObject (>= 5.0.0),
    plotly,
    htmlwidgets,
    rmarkdown,
    knitr
Notes: QC (01) and MERFISH (04) require Seurat/plotly; DifferentialExpression
    (02) and Permutation (03) need only the table/plot stack
    (data.table/dplyr/tidyr/ggplot2/ComplexHeatmap). All four target one
    environment: R 4.5 + Seurat 5.x.
